    "html": "<div class=\"lean-knowl-head\"><span class=\"lean-decl-kind\">theorem</span> <code>FiniteJetOver.chartEquiv_continuous</code></div><pre class=\"lean-source\"><code class=\"language-lean\">theorem chartEquiv_continuous (ϖ : Uniformizer K) : Continuous (chartEquiv K ϖ)</code></pre><div class=\"lean-source-meta\">projects/AdicSpaces/Adic spaces/FJP/Over/Chart.lean:1436–1436 · commit b007a4f3d422</div>",
